      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Small field but great race. SH'BOURNE POWER (4) has won three of five so far and is a progressive type unbeaten this campaign. First try at this circuit but drops in weight and is hard to fault on recent efforts. KAKIA (2) has had two tries here and placed at both. Near miss last time in a Class 5 at Hobart and will find this easier. Looks a leading chance. STARDARMUS (5) has been racing in great heart with wins at two of the last three. Drops in weight and will prove tough to beat here as always. SIMPLY DEEP (3) is another in great form, winning two back then just missing last time behind the talented Tuskegee. One of the main chances again. STONE COLD STUNNER (1) is fitter for two runs back and ready to fire.",
